     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m putting together an auto-regressive ordered logistic regression model, where the interpretation relates to the value of the latent variable yStar.</div><div><br></div><div>At the latent-variable level, the model is the following: yStar_t ~ logistic(beta * x1 + rho * yStar_{t -1}, 1)</div><div><br></div><div>At the observed-variable level: y_t ~ ordered_logistic(beta * x1 + rho * yStar_{t -1}, kappa)</div><div><br></div><div>I started with the simplest version of this model: a single cut point and a single covariate.<br></div><div><br></div><div>I set the model up in Stan in two steps:</div><div><br></div><div>(1) draws are made from the posterior for the values of yStar using a truncated logistic density: given the observed value of y, the latent variable yStar is known to be within a given range as defined by the cut point parameters</div><div><br></div><div>(2) ordered_logistic() is used to estimate the regression of interest for the observed variable</div><div><br></div><div>The problem is that I get the following error and I seem to have run out of ideas for where I&#39;m going wrong:</div><div><br></div><div><div>[299] &quot;  Log probability evaluates to log(0), i.e. negative infinity.&quot;                                       </div><div>[300] &quot;  Stan can&#39;t start sampling from this initial value.&quot;                                                 </div><div>[301] &quot;Initialization between (--2, -2) failed after 100 attempts. &quot;                                         </div><div>[302] &quot; Try specifying initial values, reducing ranges of constrained values, or reparameterizing the model.&quot;</div></div><div><br></div><div>Any suggestions for would great!</div><div><br></div><div>Simulation and model code:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>n_obs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>year </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs<br>x1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Covariate</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>beta1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Parameter on covariate x1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>rho </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Auto-regressive parameter</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>kappa </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Inf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Inf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Cut points</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>k </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Number of cut points</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>S </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">yStar </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> year </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> year</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Simulate first-order auto-regressive ordinal logistic regression data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">S</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Generate latent (linear) variable</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    S$yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Arbitrary set yStar for t = 1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    S$yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rho </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> S$yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  beta1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  rlogis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Generate observed (ordered) variable</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">S$yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> S$yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> S$y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>model_data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> S$y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> year </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> S$year</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> S$x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>model_code </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<br>data {<br><br>  int n_obs;<br><br>  int y[n_obs];<br>  int year[n_obs];<br>  real x1[n_obs];<br><br>}<br><br>parameters {<br>  <br>  vector[n_obs] yStar; # Latent variable<br>  real rho; # Auto-regression parameter<br>  <br>  vector[1] beta; # Standard covariate parameters<br>  ordered[1] kappa; # Cut points<br><br>}<br><br>transformed parameters {<br>}<br><br>model {<br><br>  // Priors<br>  rho ~ normal(0, 5);<br>  <br>  beta ~ normal(0, 5);<br>  kappa ~ normal(0, 5);<br><br>  // Prior on first latent variable<br>  if(y[1] == 1) yStar[1] ~ normal(0, 5) T[, kappa[1]];<br>  if(y[1] == 2) yStar[1] ~ normal(0, 5) T[kappa[1], ];<br><br>  // Draws for yStar<br>  for(t in 2:n_obs) {<br><br>    if(y[t] == 1) {<br>      yStar[t] ~ logistic(rho * yStar[t - 1] +<br>                          beta[1] * x1[t],<br>                          1) T[, kappa[1]];<br>    }<br>    if(y[t] == 2) {<br>      yStar[t] ~ logistic(rho * yStar[t - 1] +<br>                          beta[1] * x1[t],<br>                          1) T[kappa[1], ];<br>    }<br>  }<br><br>  // Likelihood<br>  for(t in 2:n_obs) {<br>    y[t] ~ ordered_logistic(rho * yStar[t - 1] + beta[1] * x1[t], kappa);<br>  }<br>}<br><br>generated quantities {<br>}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Compile to C</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model_latent </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan_model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model_code </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model_code</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Sample from posterior</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>posterior_latent </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sampling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model_latent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                             warmup </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                             open_progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chains </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div></div></div>"
