   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks a lot for this Ben.<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m going to have to look into how transforms work here, so I suspect I&#39;ll have a follow-up question in the next few days.</div><div><br></div><div>(Edit: found own mistake)</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><div>On Saturday, March 12, 2016 at 1:40:48 PM UTC-5, Ben Goodrich wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Greg,<br><br>On Saturday, March 12, 2016 at 1:01:02 PM UTC-5, Gregory wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">The\r\n constraint thus depends on the value(s) of kappa drawn at a given \r\niteration. Can I do this in the transformed parameter or model block? Is\r\n there another way to do this?</div></blockquote><div> <br>kappa proposed, not kappa drawn<br><br>It can be done but you have to account for the change-of-variables and such models tend not to mix well.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">parameters</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  pos_ordered</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">J </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     // be sure to estimate this intercept since kappa is positive<br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> {<br>      yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      increment_log_prob(log(kappa[1]));<br>    }<br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> J</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> {<br>      real diff;<br>      diff &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\">kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> kappa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];<br></span></code>       yStar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">diff</span><span style=\"color:#660\"></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\">ka